{"resourceIdentifier":"4070","resourceName":"Guangdong Xinsheng E-waste recovery and recycling project","description":"Guangdong Xinsheng E-waste recovery and recycling project (hereafter referred to as the project) was expanded to match the larger lead recycling capacity to handle the increasing number of renewed and phased-out waste lead-containing waste and copper-containing waste from automobiles, electric bicycles, electric motorcycles, etc. in Guangdong East and Chaozhou City, Guangdong Province. The project is invested and owned by Guangdong Xinsheng Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd. The purpose of the project activity is to recycling instead of producing materials from virgin inputs reduces overall energy consumption, avoids direct GHG emissions, and reduces the environmental impact of natural resources extraction.\r\nGiven the current status of e-waste recycling in China, it can be assumed that in the absence of the project activity the e-waste would be either not recycled or, at best, certain fractions of it would be processed by informal recovery activities.\r\nThe proposed project was designed to reduce the Greenhouse Gas emissions by recovering metals and materials through Electronic Waste collection and recycling process performed at Guangdong Xinsheng Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd. located in Rao Ping County, Chaozhou City, China. It is planned that 200,000 tons of E-waste per year will be recycled into 40,815 tons of lead and 4822.5 tons of copper at maximum production capacity. The final product obtained will be sold to local businesses. The construction start date of the project is 01/08/2020 and was put into operation on 01/09/2021.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG in the atmosphere through a avoiding extraction of raw materials and production of virgin materials.  It is estimated that the project will result a total of 416,185 tCO2e emission reductions in the first crediting period of 7 years and with annual average of 59,455 tCO2e emission reduction in the 1st crediting period.","location":{"latitude":23.776944,"longitude":116.876931},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-17","endExclusive":"2023-03-20","endInclusive":"2023-03-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4070"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Xinsheng Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4070"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59455"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.BA"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/01/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/09/2021 - 31/08/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82663&IDKEY=f903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf113992277","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"2023.01.10 Guangdong E-waste VCS PD&MR.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-13T05:38:17.387Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82667&IDKEY=m097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn878113997793","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Guang